div.p:
—if he does consolidate himself, he will have even more freedom to act against us
                    after a period of our acceptance of him than if we had opposed him all
                    along;

note.p:
Source: National Archives, Nixon Presidential Materials, NSC Files, NSC
                    Institutional Files (H-Files), Box H–29, NSC Meeting, Chile, 11/6/70. Secret;
                    Sensitive. Printed from an uninitialed copy.
